#: admin/admin.js:19
msgid "Table conversion spreadsheet"
msgstr "表格轉試算表"

#: admin/admin.js:21
msgid "Module overview"
msgstr "模組概覽"

#: admin/admin.js:22
msgid "API Server address"
msgstr "API 伺服器位址"

#: admin/admin.js:23
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方式"

#: admin/admin.js:24
msgid ""
"Use Javascript to obtain more than one HTML table in a web page and treat it "
"as text content. The content can also contain other types of HTML tags."
msgstr ""
"利用 Javascript 取得網頁內一個以上的 HTML 表格，當成文字內容，內容中亦>可含有"
"其他類型的 HTML 標籤。"

#: admin/admin.js:25
msgid ""
"Use the HTTP POST method to send the text to the API server address as the "
"form content."
msgstr "將該文字當成表單內容，利用 HTTP POST 方法，送至 API 伺服器位址。"

#: admin/admin.js:26
msgid "The form has three fields:"
msgstr "表單有三個欄位"

#: admin/admin.js:27
msgid "Title (optional), used for records, blank is not recommended."
msgstr "標題(可選)，用作紀錄用，不建議空白。"

#: admin/admin.js:28
msgid ""
"Conversion format (optional), the default is \"ods\", you can also specify "
"\"xls\", \"xlsx\" or \"pdf\"."
msgstr ""
"轉換格式(可選)，預設為 \"ods\"，亦可指定 \"xls\"、\"xlsx\" 或 \"pdf\"。"

#: admin/admin.js:29
msgid "Table content (required field)."
msgstr "表格內容(必要欄位)。"

#: admin/admin.js:30
msgid "Form example"
msgstr "表單範例"

#: admin/admin.js:32
msgid "View log"
msgstr "檢視日誌"

#: admin/admin.js:33
msgid "Refresh Log"
msgstr "更新日誌"

#: admin/admin.js:35
msgid "API testing"
msgstr "API 測試"

#: admin/admin.js:36
msgid "HTML Table"
msgstr "HTML 表格"

#: admin/admin.js:37
msgid "Download as ODF"
msgstr "下載 ODF 格式"

#: admin/admin.js:38
msgid "Download as XLSX"
msgstr "下載 Excel 格式"

#: admin/admin.js:39
msgid "Download as PDF"
msgstr "下載 PDF 格式"
